OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of people gather in
OL,4,Asupport of Drumcree Orangemen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have gathered in
OL,7,FPortadown to show support for the
OL,8,FOrange Order in the wake of the
OL,9,FDrumcree dispute.
OL,11,FHundreds of Orangemen paraded through
OL,12,Fthe town centre, joined by bands and
OL,13,Fsupporters who were not deterred by the
OL,14,Fstormy weather.
OL,16,FThe parade comes amid continuing
OL,17,Ftensions surrounding the long-running
OL,18,FDrumcree dispute, whereby the Orange
OL,19,FOrder has been banned from walking down
OL,20,Fthe mainly nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,21,Fthe County Armagh town.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
