OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of people gather in
OL,4,Asupport of Drumcree Orangemen
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant banned the contentious parade on
OL,8,Fsecurity advice after a stand-off
OL,9,Fbetween Orangemen and Garvaghy Road
OL,10,Fresidents lasting almost two weeks.
